      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "He shall take some of the blood of the bull, and sprinkle it with his finger on the mercy seat on the east; and before the mercy seat he shall sprinkle some of the blood with his finger seven times.",
      "ko": "그는 또 수송아지의 피를 취하여 손가락으로 속죄소 동편에 뿌리고 또 손가락으로 그 피를 속죄소 앞에 일곱번 뿌릴 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "378c70e75599ee604e55fe8d451bf075674290adbdddad1c128ba9658f574c60",
      "translation_text_hash": "1e7310bbbee6ee388cced06a3100e47a34f82b6de30300beaddcdd5baa17af4c",
