      "en": "“When he has finished atoning for the Holy Place, the Tent of Meeting, and the altar, he shall present the live goat.",
      "ko": "그 지성소와 회막과 단을 위하여 속죄하기를 마친 후에 산 염소를 드리되",
      "source_text_hash": "c9fda601fd67cfedbb84b3d84a228e4f36aeb5722e368a09589ddf86bf5c9836",
      "translation_text_hash": "8ef986c93be37e33686238dce988cbf2d07c7c85ddeb4ac50aa81c9db8aa63ea",
