        "verse": 27
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 27
        }
      ],
      "en": "The bull for the sin offering, and the goat for the sin offering, whose blood was brought in to make atonement in the Holy Place, shall be carried outside the camp; and they shall burn their skins, their flesh, and their dung with fire.",
      "ko": "속죄제 수송아지와 속죄제 염소의 피를 성소로 들여다가 속죄하였은즉 그 가죽과 고기와 똥을 밖으로 내어다가 불사를 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "4354b9079d73860588793054fb996afcd15c6b20ad9577436155d71debe91c9f",
      "translation_text_hash": "3c14d4f11763b7b7440cee84a5344fa8294b9e24c9e03ee827f925057ee5589b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
