      ],
      "en": "He who burns them shall wash his clothes, and bathe his flesh in water, and afterward he shall come into the camp.",
      "ko": "불사른 자는 옷을 빨고 물로 몸을 씻은 후에 진에 들어올지니라",
      "source_text_hash": "09b4636b33fe9242132ea25d706503218be5071e9a289553d09f81ecfd1b8397",
      "translation_text_hash": "758b45b26ab6331f24ffcdbfc15f192a0678ec677888d8d6326a996ca4b46a85",
