      "en": "Then he shall make atonement for the Holy Sanctuary; and he shall make atonement for the Tent of Meeting and for the altar; and he shall make atonement for the priests and for all the people of the assembly.",
      "ko": "지성소를 위하여 속죄하며 회막과 단을 위하여 속죄하고 또 제사장들과 백성의 회중을 위하여 속죄할지니",
      "source_text_hash": "42dd88c211bb25471b4ba68956613f8053ad88e66e8c802f129271937226e569",
      "translation_text_hash": "f8b53ac3e8df78feff18c8aab1891895972716e865b163f7f1841c871fb65c2a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
